    "text": "The focal chords of the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi></math> which are tangent to the circle of radius <math><mi>r</mi></math> and centre <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>6,0</mn></mfenced></math> are perpendicular, then the radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math> of the circle is",
